Vnum            559
Name            city guard~
ShortDesc       城市護衛~
LongDesc        維護城市和平的護衛(guard)在此站崗。
~
Description
他們是特別在此保護城市的安全﹐正全力專注的看著來往的行人。
~
AutoSetValue    Yes
Sentinel        Yes
Effect          'detect invis'
Effect          'detect hidden'
Effect          'sanctuary'
Alignment       100
Level           30
Hitroll         0
Protect         -1
Damroll         0
Str             -1
Int             -1
Wis             -1
Dex             -1
Con             -1
Hp              3000
Mana            -1
Move            -1
Class           CLASS_FIGHTER
Gold            -1
Multipile       100
AttackRatio     100
DodgeRatio      100
Migrate         0
Sex             SEX_MALE
Enable          26 'gdragon steps'
Enable          1 'two sword'

Process
Type            fight_prog
Chance          100
Text
if isnpc($n)
  break
endif
if isimminvis($n)
  break
endif
if isenemy($n) != '洛陽'
  mpsetenemy $n '洛陽'
endif
~
End

Process
Type            rand_prog
Chance          30
Text
if rand(10)
  say 最近收入有夠少…
  sigh
endif
~
End

Process
Type            bribe_prog
Gold            1000
Text
mppurge coins
if isnpc($n)
  break
endif
if isimminvis($n)
  break
endif
if isenemy($n) == '洛陽'
  tell $n 好了﹗你不再是公敵了﹗去玩吧﹗
  mpremenemy $n '洛陽'
  break
endif
say 給我錢做什麼﹖
~
End

Process
Type            bribe_prog
Gold            0
Text
mppurge coins
if ispc($n)
  say 給我錢做什麼﹖真奇怪﹗還是收下好了﹗
  ? $n
endif
~
End

End
